<title>JAPAN: Seiko (Shizuoka) -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Seiko (Shizuoka) -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.17		vs	    5.73</p>
<p> Operating	prft 109 million	  vs    loss 53    million</p>
<p> Current	    299    million	  vs	  144    million</p>
<p> Net		  144    million	  vs	  137    million</p>
<p> EPS		   27.54 yen	  vs	   26.22 yen</p>
<p> Shares		5 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    8.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Seiko Corp (Shizuoka) is different from the watch maker with the same name.  Makes automatic bottling machines and packaging plants.</p>
</text>
